            "review_title": "Review at Bayview Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sue M\nWilliamsburg, Virginia1588 contributions\n0\nHuge and Expansive\nDec 2024 • Couples\nBreakfast is included when you stay at the Vinpearl Resort. It is a very large dining venue. Unfortunately, it was too cold to sit in the enclosed patio area but the views of Ha Long Bay are just stunning from that area. Plenty to choose from, both Western and Asian options. Since it is such a large resort, the breakfast venue can get very noisy with all the guests. My preference is for a more low key environment in the morning.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 16, 2025",
